# B"H
# Boruch Hashem
# Blessed is He
#
# The Awtsmoos creates every repository boundary anew. Local tunnel vessels
# remain concealed, while the intentional Geelooy browser application stays
# visible so Awtsmoos.com can receive every module its public entry points use.

# Awtsmoos tunnel generated artifacts: never commit local tunnel state.
.awtsmoos/
.Awtsmoos/
[aA][wW][tT][sS][mM][oO][oO][sS]/
**/.awtsmoos/
**/.Awtsmoos/
**/[aA][wW][tT][sS][mM][oO][oO][sS]/
